{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1551355-we-need-a-sorcerer-s-guide","id":1551355,"title":"We need a Sorcerer's Guide","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-05-30T17:42:48-07:00","id":1551355,"title":"We need a Sorcerer's Guide","content":"What it says of the tin. Sorcerers, shamans, witches, ect, are figures Scions meet as allies and foes in many mythologies. Magicians seeking their own apotheosis are also a trope. Magicians becoming Titan-like beings is also a trope.<br /> <br /> I think we need a general guide to spellcasters anyway. Gods known for spellcasting need more definition too.<br /> <br /> We need a general guide to spellcasters for players, Story Guides, and anyone else focused on this game.<br /> <br /> Please, give me your reactions and ideas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-30T19:37:23-07:00","id":1551357,"title":"","content":"I second this as a person who loves the idea of playing a sorcerer but feel they need a bit more fleshing out. Also for obvious reasons if you've seen my last post. It's a common trope and The way things are worded in the Saints and Monsters guide is kind of confusing how strong they are, but that's my opinion. Something to make things feel less vague would be great.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28836-general-gratas","name":"General gratas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-07-30T10:31:10-07:00","id":1552748,"title":"","content":"I agree. Sorcery is a very neat addition to the game, but it would be nice to have more about the way Sorcery is integrated into the World, how Sorcerers interact with the supernatural and how different divinities and cults deal with Sorcerers. And also, we need more Techniques, as well as Sorcery-specific Birthrights and Edges, plus examples of Rituals and perhaps, 1 or a few Sorcery focused scenarios.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-07-31T05:57:28-07:00","id":1552768,"title":"","content":"I do like how they dabbled in doing just that with AURUM in the Wild Hunt book, but I agree, more worldbuilding around Sorcerers wouldn't hurt.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Not to mention, an actively good/heroic Sorcerer group would be nice, as so far the only two notable Sorcerer groups in the setting are mostly antagonistic forces (namely the Solomonari and AURUM)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28221,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28221-chronorebel","user":"ChronoRebel","date":". 08-24-2025, 09:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28221-chronorebel","name":"ChronoRebel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-08-22T08:32:57-07:00","id":1553373,"title":"","content":"I would like to see a different path for divinity, starting as a mortal Sorcerer.<br /> <br /> And technomagic because of reasons.<br /> <br /> Of course my headcannon includes Atlantis and the Teros, using sorcery in a scientific way. I hate the cliche that &quot;Science is not compatible with Magic&quot;, Science would be testing how and why magic works, to find edge cases, sources, etc... Nothing about denying magic.<br /> <br /> As per wikipedia &quot;<i>Science is a systematic discipline that builds and organises knowledge in the form of testable hypotheses and predictions about the universe.&quot;</i> A real scientist if shown proof of magic would not think &quot;This contradicts all I know, I must deny it!&quot;, they would go &quot;This EXPANDS on what I know, I should investigate more!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-08-22T12:25:31-07:00","id":1553381,"title":"","content":"Several different traditional mystic traditions (real world not M: t Ascension) have either a goal of becoming divine or using magic to connect with and glorify the divine. So mages seeking to become Gods or Titans ought to be part of the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}